notes: A compatibility vector. decoded_rgba_sha256 is each frame as the original decoder (lmbd-probe decode: bc7enc_rdo's scalar BC7 reference) returns it, straight RGBA8 at the frame size; DXVKit Plus must reproduce it, and re-encoding the pattern with params must reproduce this file byte for byte. Our own footage, no third-party content.
